The messy details that become public after a scandal often shape the percep=
tion of that saga in the media. With Huang, those articles were overwhelmin=
gly negative. His reincarnation as CEO was not something that close watcher=
s were expecting. There was no drumbeat of minor news stories predicting hi=
s return. It was a genuine shock after such unflattering stories pointed to=
